

  Hydroxyl radical
=========================

 Open-shell SCF calculations on the OH.(known as the hydroxyl radical) system, followed by
 complete small open shell CI method (cosci) for getting individual states.

 Ground state is X 2_Pi_3/2 resulting from the electron configuration of
 
    1 s_sig(2) 2s_sig(2) 2p_sig(2) 2p_pi_1/2(2) 2p_pi_3/2(1)


 The basis set input file brings linear symmery.

 SCF configurations
--------------------

What does not converge is the 1 electron in 1 open-shell !
.CLOSED SHELL
